/home> grep cat words.txt
cat nap
/home> grep -i cat words.txt
Cat
cat nap
/home> grep -n cat words.txt
  3  cat nap
/home> grep -in cat words.txt
  1  Cat
  3  cat nap
/home> grep -ni CAT words.txt
  1  Cat
  3  cat nap
/home> grep -x cat words.txt
grep: unknown flag: -x
/home> grep -in missing
usage: grep [-i] [-n] <text> <path>
/home> grep cat absent
grep: not found: /home/absent
/home> grep cat /home
grep: is a folder: /home
